      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      310.97,
      401.86,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Mediation Board(Amendment) Act, No. of 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.97,
      401.87,
      406.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 7 of the Mediation Board Act, No. 72 of1988 is hereby amended in paragraph (a) of subsection (1)of that section by the substitution for the words \u201ctwo hundredand fifty thousand rupees in value;\u201d of the words \u201cfivehundred thousand rupees in value;\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      418.97,
      401.9,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
